ally  control it from your phone you don't  have to go and spin dials and stuff like  that it looks really nice so it blends  into your home and said I'm in a big  kind of ugly box and you can easily move  it around so that is think is where the  value comes in now the filters there 65  bucks so I mean you can actually auto  send it out to you or send you a  notification about it because it is a  smart device it can actually sense how  much of that filter has been used up so  thank you guys for watching if you have  any questions ask down in the comment  section below I'll do my best to answer  them we have links to the molecule if  you guys want to get some more  information or if you guys want to buy  one down to the description definitely  go and check those out there some really  cool videos really cool explanations if  you guys want to learn more this has  been max with max tech and I'll see you  in the next video

